{Napier won his game against Mortimer in 53 moves. Mortimer, playing first
move in a Sicilian, made a good fight up to a certain point. In the ending,
however, Napier was two pawns ahead with an easy game. source: London Dayly
News, 13 AUG 1904, p. 11}  0-1

