[EventCountry "ENG"]

{Game score not available. Tattersall lost to Mueller in a somewhat singular
manner. An ending had been arrived at,i n which Tattersall had bishop and four
pawns against knight and four. Intending to play his bishop, he touched one of
his opponent's pawns by mistake. Unfortunately, this particular pawn could be
taken, at the loss of the bishop, and Tattersall resigned shortly afterwards.
London Daily News, 13 AUG 1904, p. 11}  1-0

